WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.048 --> 00:00:04.951
COULD SHOOT STUDENTS AND

00:00:02.748 --> 00:00:06.686
TEACHERS AS THEY FLED INTO THE

00:00:05.084 --> 00:00:08.654
HALLWAYS.

00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:08.955
&gt;&gt; Tucker: PHIL, THANK YOU FOR

00:00:08.788 --> 00:00:11.758
THAT.

00:00:09.088 --> 00:00:12.391
REBECCA BOGARD IS A SENIOR AT

00:00:11.891 --> 00:00:12.792
MARJORY STONEMAN DOUGLAS

00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:15.595
HIGH SCHOOL.

00:00:12.925 --> 00:00:17.930
SHE WAS INSIDE A CLASSROOM WHEN

00:00:15.728 --> 00:00:18.431
THE WINDOWS WERE SHOT OUT, SHE

00:00:18.064 --> 00:00:19.065
JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:00:18.564 --> 00:00:22.902
THANK YOU FOR JOINING US.

00:00:19.198 --> 00:00:25.304
WHAT DID YOU HEAR?

00:00:23.035 --> 00:00:29.008
&gt;&gt; I WAS IN CLASS AND THE

00:00:25.438 --> 00:00:30.743
FRESHMAN BUILDING, AND I HEARD

00:00:29.142 --> 00:00:31.644
GUNSHOTS, AND I DID NOT WANT TO

00:00:30.877 --> 00:00:35.314
REACT, BECAUSE I WAS NOT SURE

00:00:31.778 --> 00:00:37.116
WHAT THAT WAS.

00:00:35.448 --> 00:00:38.684
AND IT WAS LIKE, WE JUST

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:40.153
AUTOMATICALLY KNEW WHEN WE HEARD

00:00:38.818 --> 00:00:42.555
THAT TO GO INTO HIDING, BECAUSE

00:00:40.286 --> 00:00:43.489
NO ONE IN MY CLASS HAD EVER

00:00:42.822 --> 00:00:50.029
HEARD THAT BEFORE.

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:50.897
SO WE ALL WENT AND HID UNDER THE

00:00:50.196 --> 00:00:51.764
TEACHERS DESK.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:55.301
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT DID YOUR

00:00:51.898 --> 00:00:57.704
TEACHER DO WHEN THE SHOTS BEGAN?

00:00:55.435 --> 00:00:58.738
&gt;&gt; AT FIRST WE THOUGHT IT WAS A

00:00:57.837 --> 00:01:01.240
DRILL, AND NORMALLY THE TEACHERS

00:00:58.871 --> 00:01:01.741
KNEW IF IT WAS A DRILL, AND SHE

00:01:01.374 --> 00:01:04.010
LOOKED CONCERNED.

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:04.544
SO WE WERE TRYING TO STAY CALM

00:01:04.143 --> 00:01:06.346
HIDING.

00:01:04.677 --> 00:01:08.014
MOST OF THE CLASS TRIED TO STAY

00:01:06.479 --> 00:01:09.749
BEHIND HER DESK AND THERE WERE

00:01:08.147 --> 00:01:12.252
TEN KIDS ON THE OTHER SIDE BY

00:01:09.883 --> 00:01:13.720
THE COMPUTER CART NEAR THE

00:01:12.385 --> 00:01:16.923
WINDOW.

00:01:13.853 --> 00:01:18.791
AND THE TEACHER HAD HER PHONE.

00:01:17.056 --> 00:01:21.027
WE HAD SEEN HER FOR A WHILE, SHE

00:01:18.925 --> 00:01:21.761
WAS ON HER WALKING AND TALKING

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:24.697
TO ADMINISTRATION.

00:01:21.895 --> 00:01:25.732
SHE WAS ON THE PHONE WITH THE

00:01:24.831 --> 00:01:26.900
POLICE AND WE ALL STAYED CALM

00:01:25.865 --> 00:01:31.538
AND TRIED TO RELAX, NOBODY KNEW

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:32.372
WHAT WAS HAPPENING.

00:01:31.671 --> 00:01:38.712
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOW LONG DID THE

00:01:32.506 --> 00:01:40.914
SHOTS GO ON WOULD YOU SAY?

00:01:38.845 --> 00:01:42.115
&gt;&gt; FOR A WHILE, I FEEL LIKE

00:01:41.047 --> 00:01:42.949
10 MINUTES, WE HEARD IT AT FIRST

00:01:42.249 --> 00:01:46.119
AND WE WERE HIDING AND WE KNEW

00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:48.488
IT WAS REAL WHEN THEY SAW THE

00:01:46.253 --> 00:01:49.523
BULLETS, THE SHOTS GO THROUGH

00:01:48.622 --> 00:01:50.690
THE WINDOW AND GLASS SHATTERED

00:01:49.656 --> 00:01:53.527
EVERYWHERE.

00:01:50.824 --> 00:01:54.127
A COUPLE OF KIDS IN MY CLASS GOT

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:57.497
HIT.

00:01:54.261 --> 00:01:59.232
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHERE WERE YOU?

00:01:57.631 --> 00:02:01.802
&gt;&gt; I WAS HIDING WITH THE TEACHER

00:01:59.366 --> 00:02:03.537
AND A COUPLE OF STUDENTS BY HER

00:02:02.202 --> 00:02:08.508
DESK.

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:10.143
HIDING AWAY FROM THE WINDOW.

00:02:08.642 --> 00:02:13.880
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WERE THE STUDENTS

00:02:10.277 --> 00:02:16.316
IN YOUR CLASS BADLY INJURED?

00:02:14.014 --> 00:02:18.318
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW HOW BAD, IT WAS

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:22.522
HARD TO SEE, BUT WHEN I SAW THEM

00:02:18.452 --> 00:02:23.190
LEAVING, THERE WAS JUST A LOT OF

00:02:23.023 --> 00:02:24.958
BLOOD.

00:02:23.323 --> 00:02:27.094
THEY WERE PRETTY CALM ABOUT IT,

00:02:25.092 --> 00:02:27.394
BUT IT WAS REALLY TRAUMATIC TO

00:02:27.227 --> 00:02:28.929
WATCH.

00:02:27.527 --> 00:02:31.732
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT IS JUST AWFUL.

00:02:29.062 --> 00:02:34.334
DID YOU KNOW THE MAN ACCUSED OF

00:02:31.865 --> 00:02:36.937
DOING THIS?

00:02:34.468 --> 00:02:38.372
&gt;&gt; I DO NOT.

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:41.708
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HAD YOU HEARD HIS

00:02:38.505 --> 00:02:43.210
NAME OR WERE YOU AWARE OF HIM?

00:02:41.842 --> 00:02:46.580
&gt;&gt; I HAD HEARD HIS NAME BEFORE,

00:02:43.343 --> 00:02:48.315
BUT I DID NOT KNOW, I THINK THAT

00:02:46.714 --> 00:02:49.617
HE WORKS AT ONE OF THE LOCAL

00:02:48.449 --> 00:02:51.051
STORES HERE, SO WHEN I SAW THE

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:52.286
PICTURE I KNEW THAT HE LOOKED

00:02:51.185 --> 00:02:54.355
FAMILIAR, BUT I DID NOT KNOW

00:02:52.419 --> 00:02:55.222
MUCH ABOUT HIM.

00:02:54.488 --> 00:02:56.991
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT KIND OF STORE

00:02:56.524 --> 00:02:59.293
IS IT?

00:02:57.124 --> 00:03:01.595
&gt;&gt; THE DOLLAR STORE.

00:02:59.426 --> 00:03:03.731
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THE DOLLAR STORE.

00:03:01.729 --> 00:03:06.600
INTERESTING.

00:03:03.864 --> 00:03:09.303
HAVE YOU GONE THROUGH DRILLS FOR

00:03:06.734 --> 00:03:11.706
A SITUATION LIKE THIS?

00:03:09.437 --> 00:03:12.907
&gt;&gt; YES, WE WERE PRETTY PREPARED,

00:03:11.839 --> 00:03:13.941
WE KNOW TO STAY AWAY FROM

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:17.378
WINDOWS AND EVERYTHING, BUT WE

00:03:14.075 --> 00:03:18.579
WERE TRYING TO DO THAT, BUT ONCE

00:03:17.511 --> 00:03:20.147
THE BULLETS WENT THROUGH THE

00:03:18.713 --> 00:03:22.416
WINDOW AND THE GLASS SHATTERED,

00:03:20.281 --> 00:03:25.286
WE KNEW IT WAS THE REAL THING

00:03:22.617 --> 00:03:27.121
THAT THIS IS NOT A DRILL OR

00:03:25.419 --> 00:03:28.556
ANYTHING, AND WHEN PEOPLE GOT

00:03:27.254 --> 00:03:29.323
HIT, THEY WERE SCREAMING IN

00:03:28.689 --> 00:03:30.925
PANIC MODE.

00:03:29.457 --> 00:03:33.995
THEY DID NOT KNOW WHAT TO DO, SO

00:03:31.058 --> 00:03:37.598
WE TRY TO KEEP EVERYONE QUIET

00:03:34.128 --> 00:03:38.399
AND AS QUICK AS WE COULD, WE

00:03:37.732 --> 00:03:39.100
WANTED EVERYBODY TO REMAIN CALM

00:03:38.532 --> 00:03:41.702
AT THE TIME.

00:03:39.834 --> 00:03:42.436
I DID NOT KNOW THAT ANY STUDENTS

00:03:41.836 --> 00:03:44.505
WERE SHOT AND THEN SOMEONE TOLD

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:47.108
ME IN MY CLASS THAT WAS SITTING

00:03:44.639 --> 00:03:48.276
NEXT TO ME, BUT THE BULLETS WERE

00:03:47.241 --> 00:03:50.945
EXTREMELY LOUD, NOTHING THAT I

00:03:48.409 --> 00:03:52.847
HAD EVER HEARD BEFORE.

00:03:51.078 --> 00:03:54.982
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DID YOU TEXT YOUR

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:57.718
PARENTS FROM THE CLASSROOM?

00:03:55.116 --> 00:04:02.323
&gt;&gt; I DID NOT HAVE MY PHONE AT

00:03:57.852 --> 00:04:04.492
THE TIME, BUT MY PARENTS KNEW.

00:04:02.457 --> 00:04:06.928
SO AFTERWARDS THE S.W.A.T. TEAM

00:04:04.625 --> 00:04:09.597
CAME AND ASKED HOW MANY PEOPLE

00:04:07.061 --> 00:04:10.698
WERE INJURED OR IF THERE WERE

00:04:09.731 --> 00:04:12.300
ANY DEATHS OR INJURIES.

00:04:10.832 --> 00:04:13.201
WE TOLD THEM HOW MANY STUDENTS,

00:04:12.433 --> 00:04:16.704
I THINK THERE WERE 30 STUDENTS

00:04:13.334 --> 00:04:19.107
IN OUR CLASS.

00:04:16.838 --> 00:04:20.074
SO WE ALL LINED UP ONE BY ONE,

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:23.511
WALKED OUT, WE HAD TO RUN AS FAR

00:04:20.208 --> 00:04:23.811
AS WE COULD AND WE OUGHT TO STAY

00:04:23.645 --> 00:04:25.713
CALM.

00:04:23.945 --> 00:04:27.482
IT WAS REALLY HARD WALKING

00:04:25.847 --> 00:04:28.516
EVERYONE, PEOPLE WERE CRYING AND

00:04:27.615 --> 00:04:29.684
THERE WAS A LOT OF BLOOD

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:31.920
EVERYWHERE LEAVING THE HALLWAY,

00:04:29.817 --> 00:04:37.191
LOOKING ON THE FLOOR AND SEEING

00:04:32.053 --> 00:04:38.092
BLOOD AND KIDS, IT WAS JUST SUCH

00:04:37.325 --> 00:04:38.960
A SCARY SCENE.

00:04:38.226 --> 00:04:41.496
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHEN DID YOUR

00:04:39.093 --> 00:04:41.796
PARENTS FIND OUT THAT YOU WERE

00:04:41.629 --> 00:04:44.198
OKAY?

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:46.501
&gt;&gt; ONCE I LEFT, MY BACKPACK AND

00:04:44.332 --> 00:04:48.903
EVERYTHING IS STILL IN CLASS.

00:04:46.634 --> 00:04:50.338
MY CAR AS THEY ARE MY KEYS, I

00:04:49.037 --> 00:04:52.307
JUST GRABBED MY PHONE AND RAN.

00:04:50.471 --> 00:04:52.607
AND MY MOM CALLED ME A BUNCH OF

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.943
TIMES.

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:56.177
I WAS NOT ANSWERING, SO SHE WAS

00:04:55.076 --> 00:04:57.412
WORRIED, BUT I CALLED HER AS I

00:04:56.311 --> 00:05:00.181
WAS WALKING AWAY.

00:04:57.879 --> 00:05:02.850
I WAS WITH A BUNCH OF KIDS SO I

00:05:00.315 --> 00:05:03.918
FELT SAFE AND WALKED AS FAR AS I

00:05:02.984 --> 00:05:06.087
COULD.

00:05:04.052 --> 00:05:07.188
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YOU ARE SO CALM

00:05:06.221 --> 00:05:07.856
RIGHT NOW, I CANNOT IMAGINE

00:05:07.322 --> 00:05:11.326
SEEING SOMETHING LIKE THAT.

00:05:07.989 --> 00:05:13.495
HOW DO YOU FEEL?

00:05:11.459 --> 00:05:15.296
&gt;&gt; BEFORE I WAS SHAKING, THE

00:05:13.628 --> 00:05:17.599
ENTIRE TIME I WAS SHAKING, BUT

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:17.866
NOW I AM STILL IN SHOCK RIGHT

00:05:17.732 --> 00:05:20.268
NOW.

00:05:17.999 --> 00:05:22.604
IT IS UNBELIEVABLE TO ACTUALLY

00:05:20.402 --> 00:05:25.073
THINK THAT THIS HAPPENED HERE AT

00:05:22.737 --> 00:05:27.109
MARJORY STONEMAN DOUGLAS.

00:05:25.207 --> 00:05:28.510
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HAVE YOU EVER FELT

00:05:27.242 --> 00:05:29.911
THREATENED THERE BEFORE?

00:05:28.644 --> 00:05:32.914
&gt;&gt; NO, NEVER.

00:05:30.045 --> 00:05:34.316
I KNOW THAT THE STAFF TRAINED

00:05:33.048 --> 00:05:36.251
US, AND IS REALLY GOOD AT

00:05:34.449 --> 00:05:37.519
TRAINING US FOR ANYTHING,

00:05:36.385 --> 00:05:38.520
TORNADO DRILL, HURRICANE DRILL,

00:05:37.653 --> 00:05:39.921
ESPECIALLY THIS.

00:05:38.654 --> 00:05:41.857
I THINK THAT EVERYBODY REACTED

00:05:40.055 --> 00:05:44.293
WELL, AND THE TEACHERS HAD THE

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:45.060
DOOR LOCKED, SO THAT WAS GOOD.

00:05:44.426 --> 00:05:47.329
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WAS YOUR TEACHER

00:05:45.194 --> 00:05:50.099
CALM THE WHOLE TIME?

00:05:47.463 --> 00:05:53.902
&gt;&gt; MY TEACHER WAS PRETTY CALM.

00:05:50.232 --> 00:05:55.137
SHE WAS ON THE PHONE AND BEING

00:05:54.036 --> 00:05:57.473
QUIET ON THE PHONE.

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.773
SO HERBIE AND CALM KEPT US ALL

00:05:57.606 --> 00:06:01.710
CALM.

00:05:57.906 --> 00:06:02.878
BUT WE ARE ALL THERE FOR EACH

00:06:01.844 --> 00:06:06.515
OTHER AND CUDDLED UP TOGETHER

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:08.117
HOLDING HANDS.

